    "tpc_book": "<div><strong>吳妍儀譯，</strong><strong>2021</strong><strong>，<em>洞見：像社會學家一樣批判思考，美國思辨教育的共同必修課，用以檢驗各種主張與立論依據的能力</em>，麥田出版。</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>周宜芳譯，</strong><strong>2019</strong><strong>，<em>設計思考全攻略：概念</em></strong><strong><em>X</em></strong><strong><em>流程</em></strong><strong><em>X</em></strong><strong><em>工具</em></strong><strong><em>X</em></strong><strong><em>團隊，史丹佛最受歡迎的商業設計課一次就上手</em></strong><strong>, </strong><strong>天下雜誌出版。</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>洪蘭譯，</strong><strong>2018</strong><strong>，<em>快思慢想</em></strong><strong>(</strong><strong>新版</strong><strong>)</strong><strong>，天下文化。</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>楊玉齡譯，</strong><strong>2020</strong><strong>，<em>反智：不願說理的人是偏執，不會說理的人是愚蠢，不敢說理的人是奴隸</em>，天下文化。</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>劉慧玉，</strong><strong>2016</strong><strong>，<em>丹麥人為什麼這麼有創造力</em>，臉譜出版社。</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>劉懷仁譯，</strong><strong>2021</strong><strong>，<em>多模型思維：天才的</em></strong><strong><em>32</em></strong><strong><em>個思考策略</em></strong><strong>，天下文化。原著</strong><strong>Scott E. Page, 2018, The Model Thinker: What You Need to Know to Make Data Work for You, Commonwealth Pub. ISBN</strong><strong>：</strong><strong>978986-5250379.</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>蕭瑞麟，</strong><strong>2020</strong><strong>，<em>服務隨創：少力設計的邏輯思維</em>，五南。</strong></div>\n",
